	<p><strong>NOTICE OF PUBLIC RECORD REQUEST</strong></p>
<p>THE CUSTODIAN OF PUBLIC RECORDS FOR THE DISTRICT IS GOVERNMENTAL MANAGEMENT SERVICES- CENTRAL FLORIDA, LLC. TO REQUEST PUBLIC RECORDS FROM THE DISTRICT YOU MAY CONTACT THE CUSTODIAN AT 219 E. LIVINGSTON ST., ORLANDO FL, 32801 TELEPHONE: 407-841–5524 FAX: 407-839-1526 EMAIL: RECORDREQUEST@GMSCFL.COM</p>

